%% PyaarPremaKaadhal On-Device AI Execution Flow Sequence Diagram
%% Color Palette: Ivory #FFF9F7, Blush Pink #F9E4EA, Rose #E79BAF, Deep Plum #47223B, Soft Gold #C9A27E

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (Client App)
    participant UI as Jetpack Compose UI
    participant NPU as Snapdragon NPU (LiteRT + QNN)
    participant Gemma as Gemma 3 (4B QAT int4)
    participant Embed as EmbeddingGemma (300M)
    participant Guard as PII Guardrail Interceptor
    participant DB as Encrypted Room DB

    rect rgb(249, 228, 234)
    note right of User: Phase 1: 2-Day AI Conversation
    User->>UI: Input Chat Message
    UI->>NPU: Submit Prompt Context
    NPU->>Gemma: Execute Stream Inference (~28 tok/s)
    Gemma-->>UI: Stream Tokens to Screen
    UI->>DB: Save Encrypted Turn Log
    end

    rect rgb(231, 155, 175)
    note right of User: Phase 2: Vector Extraction & MRL Compression
    DB->>NPU: Fetch 2-Day Summarized Dialogue
    NPU->>Embed: Generate 768-dim Embedding
    Embed->>NPU: Matryoshka Compression (MRL)
    NPU-->>DB: Save 128-dim Vector & Niche Tags
    end

    rect rgb(201, 162, 126)
    note right of User: Phase 4: Anonymous Chat Guardrail
    User->>Guard: Send Text "Call me at 9876543210"
    Guard->>Guard: Tier 1 Regex Interceptor (Detects Phone Number!)
    Guard-->>User: BLOCK Message & Display Warning Alert
    end
